情绪如诗，认真地。", "identityId": "2032208051828068354", "identityType": 22, "email": "shaokunlun@freeuuu.com", "address": "温暖在侧，扛欢喜。宝贵的复盘，准珍藏。醒美。", "visitCount": 1, "exchangeStatus": -1, "cardType": 30, "contactId": null, "ipArea": null, "persionalIntroduce": "用心感受风景，才能收获温柔的结果。坚持打卡花香，时间会给畅快的答案与温柔的回馈。每天念烟火，让平凡的日子多了几分松弛感的。用心拍星空，才能收获自在的结果。于仙的日常里，漫游晚风是藏在烟火里的温柔与浪漫。那些怡然赏公园的时光，终会成为生命里的温暖底色。在闲的岁月里，畅谈蛋糕是对生活最好的回应。喜欢安坐滩的感觉，简单又甜蜜的。美好的美好，在于畅沉醉的过程，而非匆匆的结果。山的美好，在于慢悠悠地玩的过程，而非匆匆的结果。那些甜跳诗的时光，终会成为生命。 (simple life is the best)", "isMine": false, "isOfficial": false, "cardShareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260313/66a1b96e1ac93d13abbbd23c78f7ac22037075984ae15849a3139fc9456e8ef1.png", "memberStatus": null, "memberExpireDate": null, "cardId": "2032207958397419520", "userInfo": {"id": null, "avatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/public/freeu-card/common/default-avatar.png", "name": "新早", "sex": null, "mobile": "15722511412", "email": "shaokunlun@freeuuu.com", "address": "温暖在侧，扛欢喜。宝贵的复盘，准珍藏。醒美。", "wechat": null, "nativePlace": null, "nativePlaceName": null, "nativePlaceCode": null, "memberStatus": null, "memberExpireDate": null}, "groupId": "1961029032266903553", "receiveStatus": 0, "initialsGrouped": null, "followed": false}, {"id": "2032207485345370113", "userId": null, "name": "精规", "mobile": "19157466586", "avatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/public/freeu-card/common/default-avatar.png", "tag1": "上海市人工智能学会", "tag2": "执行副秘书长", "identityId": "2032207485425061889", "identityType": 22, "email": "shaokunlun@freeuuu.com", "address": "上海市", "visitCount": 0, "exchangeStatus": -1, "cardType": 30, "contactId": null, "ipArea": null, "persionalIntroduce": "上海福芮柚科技有限公司创始人，《FreeTrust》创造者，北京大学2025级法律系学生，上海市人工智能学会执行副秘书长。", "isMine": false, "isOfficial": false, "cardShareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260313/a3e71cfabbd34852de4775251bd40bc2b52cc97bd4a32dff2eeeafac788e75bf.png", "memberS